Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:51.95,0:01:55.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这孩子…今天也打算逃学吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.20,0:02:01.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣，起床了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:01.10,0:02:02.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你打算什么时候去上课
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}已经第五天了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:04.40,0:02:06.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}初号机已经完全修好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:06.60,0:02:08.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}驾驶员这个样子怎么行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:09.40,0:02:10.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.00,0:02:30.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}出走了吗…也难怪…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.60,0:02:43.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.90,0:02:46.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}呃…那个…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.60,0:02:51.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们是碇的同班同学，相田和铃原
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:52.30,0:02:53.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}相田和铃原
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.20,0:02:54.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是                               是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.80,0:02:57.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我…是铃原
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.75,0:03:00.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}该不会就是进入初号机插入栓的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.70,0:03:03.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是的，上次给你们添了很大麻烦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.60,0:03:08.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}其实，因为那以后碇一直告假在家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:08.10,0:03:10.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有些担心，所以过来看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.20,0:03:14.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣啊…正在 NERV 的训练设施
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这样啊…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.60,0:03:19.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是堆在课桌上的讲义，碇的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:20.00,0:03:22.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不好意思让你们特地送来，谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.60,0:03:24.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么我们失陪了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:24.80,0:03:26.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}请代我问候碇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:27.00,0:03:28.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯，我会的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:29.10,0:03:30.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就这样啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.80,0:03:38.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是意料之外的发展呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.30,0:03:40.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真是个大美人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.05,0:03:45.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.95,0:03:51.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}笨蛋…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.95,0:03:59.90,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}下一站，长尾峰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.50,0:04:02.90,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}出口换至右侧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.35,0:05:07.90,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}感谢您今天搭乘第 3 新东京市第 7 环线
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.50,0:05:12.00,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}本列车将往回行驶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:12.40,0:05:16.00,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}请各位下车的时候不要忘记随身携带的东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.10,0:05:23.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}该回去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.80,0:05:25.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那位先生，等等…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.00,0:05:26.70,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(100,100)}{}便宜哟便宜哟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.00,0:05:29.80,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(100,100)}{}年轻滑嫩的美少女们出血大放送
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.00,0:05:32.80,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(100,100)}{}让我们带着极度疲劳的您前往极乐世界吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.00,0:05:26.70,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(100,100)}{}释放一天的重压
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.50,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(100,100)}{}特别大放送
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.50,0:05:30.00,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(100,100)}{}充沛您明天的活力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.00,0:05:31.70,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(100,100)}{}特别大放送
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:35.20,0:05:37.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真的无法探测吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.00,0:05:37.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.21,0:05:40.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}直径数十毫米的物体以相当于光速百分之几十的速度
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.61,0:05:43.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}撞击了南极
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.20,0:05:46.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}以我们的科学水平既无法预测也无法预防啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.90,0:05:47.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}外面简直就是地狱啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:47.91,0:05:49.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这样的话，科学对我们还有什么意义
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.40,0:05:55.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在，因为地轴偏移大气流动减少至 3%
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.40,0:05:57.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么，外面稍微平静一点了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.50,0:06:01.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不行！海啸来了！以 230 M/S 的速度接近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:01.05,0:06:02.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}博士！走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.55,0:06:05.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不，我有义务留守这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.25,0:06:07.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}博士，人要死很简单
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.00,0:06:10.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是你有继续关注这个地狱般世界的义务…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.00,0:07:23.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}笨蛋…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只有 14 岁而已啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:20.00,0:08:23.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}背负人类的存亡毕竟还是太沉重了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.20,0:08:29.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是，我们只能将 EVA 交由 14 岁的孩子操纵
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.30,0:08:31.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.65,0:08:33.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对了，真嗣和你联络了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:35.80,0:08:36.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.60,0:08:43.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有，他也许不会回来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.80,0:08:44.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你有什么打算
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.40,0:08:49.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没什么…或许不回来比较好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:50.20,0:08:50.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.00,0:08:54.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}最近那次战斗后…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:56.10,0:08:58.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么无视我的命令
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.40,0:09:00.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.20,0:09:04.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你的作战负责人是我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.10,0:09:04.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.00,0:09:09.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你有服从我命令的义务，明白吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.10,0:09:10.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.00,0:09:11.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}希望以后不要再有这种情况
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:11.90,0:09:12.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.60,0:09:14.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你真的懂吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.30,0:09:15.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我说你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:17.10,0:09:18.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不是什么事都随便回答“是、是”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.70,0:09:20.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就可以了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.90,0:09:25.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我都明白啊，又有什么关系，反正都打赢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:26.50,0:09:30.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}虽然这样表面上迎合别人可能很轻松
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.50,0:09:33.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但用那种心态驾驶 EVA 是会死的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.60,0:09:35.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没关系…那种事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.30,0:09:38.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}很有觉悟啊，虽然想这么说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.00,0:09:42.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过你以为我是在夸奖你就大错特错了，碇真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.90,0:09:46.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不管是夸奖还是怎么，反正只有我能驾驶不是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:48.30,0:09:49.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我会去驾驶的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}原来如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:54.50,0:09:58.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果对他来说驾驶 EVA 意味着痛苦的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.35,0:09:59.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那还是不要驾驶为好…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.25,0:10:02.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一定会死的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:02.90,0:10:05.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但我们需要驾驶员
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.60,0:10:14.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}小队长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.70,0:10:16.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}走，相田，快走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:17.40,0:10:21.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是，我没法丢下小队长，对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.80,0:10:23.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}笨蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.40,0:10:42.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}转校生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:43.60,0:10:44.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.50,0:11:04.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}冬二那家伙已经反省过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.70,0:11:07.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好像被他妹妹教训了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.60,0:11:11.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}“我们可是被那个机器人救了的哦”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.10,0:11:15.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}被小学低年级学生说教了，真的哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:16.70,0:11:17.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}晚上真好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}听不到吵闹的蝉鸣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:26.10,0:11:29.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}小时候很安静的，现在一年比一年吵
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:30.70,0:11:34.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是生态恢复了，美里小姐这么说的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:35.80,0:11:37.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}美里小姐啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.60,0:11:38.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真的很羡慕你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}能和那么漂亮的大姐姐住在一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.80,0:11:43.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又能操纵 EVANGELION
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:44.60,0:11:48.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只要一次就好了，真想尽情操纵 EVANGELION
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.50,0:11:50.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还是算了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.10,0:11:52.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你母亲会担心的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:55.10,0:11:57.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那你大可放心，因为我母亲不在了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}和碇你一样…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}饭…要吃吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.10,0:12:07.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.40,0:12:10.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你常常做这种事吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.50,0:12:13.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯…是呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:13.50,0:12:16.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是为了游击战时所做的训练
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:17.00,0:12:21.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这种玩具能做什么啊，只是兴趣而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.00,0:12:48.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是碇真嗣吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.90,0:12:49.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.00,0:12:52.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我是 NERV 安全情报部的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:52.60,0:12:57.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}根据安全条例第 8 条的规定，我要把你带回总部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:57.80,0:12:58.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没问题吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.00,0:12:59.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.40,0:13:06.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以你就一声不吭看着他走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.00,0:13:11.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有什么办法，对方是 NERV 安全情报部，职业的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.65,0:13:13.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那又怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.70,0:13:16.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你到底长没长 ×× 啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:16.40,0:13:17.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}讨厌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.10,0:13:17.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}变态
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.65,0:13:18.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}猴子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:18.30,0:13:21.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明知打不过还硬上的人是笨蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:21.20,0:13:22.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}和 ×× 没有关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.60,0:13:35.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好久不见了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.40,0:13:37.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.50,0:13:41.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这两天四处闲逛，心情好点了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.70,0:13:42.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:43.10,0:13:46.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}EVA 在待机了，坐吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.10,0:13:48.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不坐吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.40,0:13:52.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不骂我吗，离家出走的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.60,0:13:59.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}当然的了，美里小姐是外人嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.00,0:14:04.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果我说不坐的话，初号机怎么处理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:05.50,0:14:07.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}丽会去坐吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.40,0:14:09.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你不坐吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:10.20,0:14:15.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我怎么能那么做…把事情全部推给她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.60,0:14:18.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}别担心，我会去坐的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你不想坐吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:19.90,0:14:23.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是啊，因为这种事不适合我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.40,0:14:27.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过绫波、美里和律子…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:27.50,0:14:28.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你说够了没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.40,0:14:31.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这跟别人有什么关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:31.50,0:14:33.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}讨厌就离开这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:33.30,0:14:35.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}把 EVA 和我们全部忘掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:35.60,0:14:37.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}回复原来的生活
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:39.20,0:14:42.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}让你以这种心情去驾驶…我可不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:53.30,0:14:57.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}第三适格者明天要离开第 3 新东京市
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:57.25,0:14:59.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那就将初号机的数据改为丽的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.20,0:15:01.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.60,0:15:04.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不管零号机再启动实验结果如何
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:04.80,0:15:06.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}都转到初号机的实验
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.30,0:15:14.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}根据马尔杜克的报告
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:14.45,0:15:17.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}第四适格者（Fourth Children）还没有找到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.20,0:15:20.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也就是说无法补充驾驶员吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.80,0:15:27.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}请问…美里小姐在哪？我想要和她道别
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.90,0:15:33.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你已经不是 NERV 的人，无可奉告
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:46.80,0:15:48.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇，你忘记的东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.60,0:16:01.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个…就一会儿可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:05.00,0:16:07.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个…谢谢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.00,0:16:12.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}冬二，说呀！快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.30,0:16:19.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇，不好意思上次打了你两拳，你也揍我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:19.60,0:16:20.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我不能那么做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.26,0:16:23.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}拜托了！不然我不会安心的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:23.80,0:16:25.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他就是这么怕羞的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:26.00,0:16:28.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果那样能圆满解决的话，你就揍他吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.20,0:16:31.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.10,0:16:33.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}快啊！没时间了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那…一拳就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:36.70,0:16:37.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好！来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:42.35,0:16:43.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}慢着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:45.50,0:16:46.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要手下留情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.30,0:16:52.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}痛…
