Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.60,0:17:10.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}直觉啦，最近已经送走了几十个同学
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.00,0:17:14.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要是碇不在的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.90,0:17:18.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们有一天也不得不离开这个城市吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:18.30,0:17:21.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但我们是不会说什么的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.40,0:17:25.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为我们看到你在 EVA 中痛苦的情形
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:25.90,0:17:29.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果有人说碇你的坏话…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.50,0:17:31.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我就一拳把他打个半死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.30,0:17:37.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要一副忧郁的表情嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.90,0:17:38.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}保重哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:39.30,0:17:40.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}加油哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.35,0:17:41.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:42.90,0:17:43.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}时间到了
