Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:15.10,0:18:18.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我卑鄙…胆小…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.90,0:18:22.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}…狡滑…懦弱…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.20,0:18:25.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要再为难我们了
